*FTP, behind INCLUDE_FTP: the command table entry, its *HELP line and the
include.

ftp.asm is this project's own source and talks to the Pi-side FTP service in
pi-side/pi1mhz, which Pi1MHz does not carry. Service commands 128 to 133.

Off in the image Pi1MHz serves. *FTP costs 1,295 bytes, and upstream's merged
image has 268 free; it fits only with INCLUDE_RAMDISK=0, and which of
upstream's features gives way is upstream's decision. build_rom.sh passes
INCLUDE_FTP=0 to every image unless INCLUDE_FTP=1 is set.

diff --git a/1mhzwifi.asm b/1mhzwifi.asm
